        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: EasyBus, EasyJet Switzerland\n- Places: London, Manchester, Geneva Airport, Meyrin, Geneva\n- Topics: Express coach transport, low-cost airlines\n\nFacts:\n- EasyBus is a British express coach operator.\n- EasyBus connects the city centres of London and Manchester with their respective main airports.\n- EasyBus also provides services from Geneva Airport to nearby communities.\n- EasyJet Switzerland is based at Geneva Airport.\n- EasyJet Switzerland SA, styled as easyJet, is a Swiss low-cost airline based in Meyrin, Geneva.",
